<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verify Your Account</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFA000 100%);
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .otp-box {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border: 2px dashed #FFB800;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .otp-code {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFB800;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background: #FFB800;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🚀 Queens OS</h1>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9;">Customer Relation Hub</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h2 style="color: #333; margin-top: 0;">Hi {{firstName}},</h2>
      
      <p>Welcome to Queens OS! To complete your registration and verify your email address, please use the verification code below:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-box">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">Your Verification Code</p>
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">This code expires in 10 minutes</p>
      </div>
      
      <p>If you didn't create an account with Queens OS, please ignore this email.</p>
      
      <p style="margin-top: 30px; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>The Queens OS Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} Queens OS Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">The unified transport operating system for emerging markets.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
